    {
      "id": "claim_77814b281a8c4c4c90e13a1df4c17cf4",
      "statement": "The core vocabulary is Event (the only way in) and Effect (the only way out); on_event is the only way behavioral state advances, and the production executor and deterministic simulator both feed it events and perform the returned effects so the two cannot diverge.",
