    },
    {
      "id": "claim_791848702aef42b9ab4418535f6cf904",
      "statement": "The executable runs one serial actor that is the only caller of on_event; the actor polls its mailbox, timers, and in-flight effect futures together so monotonic lease ticks can fence the node even when a storage operation hangs, without spawning a task per effect.",
